			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 130280201,
					"content": "来到营地之后，两只蕈兽很顺利地被接纳了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280202
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 130280202,
					"content": "这里的蕈兽好像记得我们，对我们特别温和。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280203,
					"content": "看来那个元素生命在这里的地位真的很高。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "纳西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280204,
					"content": "欸，你们干嘛，是想和我玩吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280205,
					"content": "♩~♩~",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "浮游风蕈兽"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280206,
					"content": "#好啦好啦，那，{NICKNAME}，我去和它们玩一会儿？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280207,
						130280208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280207,
					"content": "去吧去吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280209
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 130280209,
					"content": "有件事我想和你道歉，就是在阿佩普的体内，「火种」破碎的时候…我想要消耗我的力量。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "纳西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280210,
					"content": "派蒙和你说了吗？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280211,
						130280212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "纳西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280211,
					"content": "嗯，我觉得很担心。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280213
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 130280213,
					"content": "我还是不够冷静，那时候我应该再多想一想，做出更加周全的判断。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "纳西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280214,
					"content": "但我只要想到草龙危在旦夕，整个须弥的人都处于威胁之中，我就觉得焦急和害怕。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "纳西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280215,
					"content": "如果有能做的事最后却决定不做，如果还没有用尽力气就耗光了时间…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "纳西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280216,
					"content": "使用力量是最简单的，但其实也是最困难的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "纳西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280217,
					"content": "还需要不断「成长」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280218
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 130280218,
					"content": "嗯，我觉得它们教会了我很多。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "纳西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280219,
					"content": "在听到「得偿所愿」这几个字的时候，我可以理解，但迟迟无法接受。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "纳西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280220,
					"content": "我不知道为什么它的声音听起来那么轻快，明明是这么让人想哭的一件事…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280221
					],
					"speakerTitle": "纳西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280221,
					"content": "我又一次，没办法「共情」了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280222,
						130280223
					],
					"speakerTitle": "纳西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280222,
					"content": "这不是你的问题。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280224
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 130280224,
					"content": "谢谢你能安慰我…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280225
					],
					"speakerTitle": "纳西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280225,
					"content": "感情真的很复杂，看来我还要继续学习才行。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280226
					],
					"speakerTitle": "纳西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280226,
					"content": "欸？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280227
					],
					"speakerTitle": "纳西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280227,
					"content": "♪~",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280228
					],
					"speakerTitle": "浮游水蕈兽"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280228,
					"content": "♪~♪~",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280229
					],
					"speakerTitle": "浮游水蕈兽"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280229,
					"content": "它们居然知道应该怎么照料农田…可能只是在有样学样吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280230
					],
					"speakerTitle": "纳西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280230,
					"content": "但既然那只蕈兽都能开口说话，说不定这都是元素力长期以来的影响。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280231
					],
					"speakerTitle": "纳西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280231,
					"content": "时间是有力量的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280232
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 130280232,
					"content": "没错，这下子两只元素生命的担忧都消失了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280233
					],
					"speakerTitle": "纳西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280233,
					"content": "之后这个营地就交给我来照看吧，我会时不时过来看看这里的情况。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280234
					],
					"speakerTitle": "纳西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280234,
					"content": "我希望保存它们留下的痕迹，为了它们在未来的邂逅创造可能性。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280235
					],
					"speakerTitle": "纳西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280235,
					"content": "毕竟，最后它想起了「努尔」这个名字啊，它的记忆回来了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280236,
						130280237
					],
					"speakerTitle": "纳西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280236,
					"content": "我相信亲情。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280238
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 130280238,
					"content": "嗯，权当是一个美好的期愿吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280239
					],
					"speakerTitle": "纳西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280239,
					"content": "纳西妲，蕈兽它们又拿水果过来了，一起来吃吧！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280240
					],
					"speakerTitle": "派蒙"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280240,
					"content": "好的，我这就来！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "纳西妲"
				},
				{
					"id": 130280237,
					"content": "我相信奇迹。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280238
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 130280223,
					"content": "我和你的情绪相同。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280224
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 130280212,
					"content": "嗯，我觉得很生气。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280213
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 130280208,
					"content": "玩得开心。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						130280209
					]
				}
			]
		}
	]
